   "id": "2264e99acb81c98bc150e4a55733a5bfc6e6f6c5",
   "message": "docs(study): fix material path contract and input transfer; allow a prepare-only rehearsal\n\nAttempt G passed every media gate for both recordings (SPS, encodes,\ninventories, structural reference gates) and refused at the model material\nloader because the runbook prescribed absolute paths for project-relative\narguments. A read-only loader diagnostic on a scratch copy then showed five\nSHA-pinned patch receipts missing from the bootstrap transfer. Retain G\nevidence, correct the runbook, and allow one non-accepted prepare-only\nrehearsal before the last attempt H.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
   "timestamp": "2026-10-05T13:43:18Z",
